{"abstract":"Forty years ago development started on Mix, a partial evaluator designed specifically for the purpose of self-Application. The effort, led by Neil D. Jones at the University of Copenhagen, eventually demonstrated that non-Trivial compilers could be generated automatically by applying a partial evaluator to itself. The possibility, in theory, of such self-Application had been known for more than a decade, but remained unrealized by the start of 1984. We describe the genesis of Mix, including the research environment, the challenges, and the main insights that led to success. We emphasize the critical role played by program annotation as a pre-processing step, later automated in the form of binding-Time analysis.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Sestoft, Peter","Søndergaard, Harald"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-718884"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"country":["Australia"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Melbourne"],"keyword":["Partial evaluation mixed computation Lisp self application auto projector compilation compiler generation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the genesis of mix early days of self applicable partial evaluation invited contribution","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/102597804/mix-history-20231218T0709.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-718884","identifier":[{"id":"85182930621","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-88bb5d01-eb12-4000-8143-c8ce327eea19"],"keyword":["Partial evaluation, mixed computation, Lisp, self- application, auto-projector, compilation, compiler generation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-5906330EF931C3ACB3F2CE3C08637019"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/102597804/mix-history-20231218T0709.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"au","key":"university of melbourne","loc":["Australia","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"University of Melbourne","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"sestoftpau","last":"Sestoft","locid":"0ee7ba1e-3108-4db3-a908-97977980d032","name":"Sestoft, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-5843-6021","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Harald","key":"søndergaardpau","last":"Søndergaard","name":"Søndergaard, Harald","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3635800.3637445","eisbn":["9798400704871/24/01"],"isbn":["9798400704871"],"pages":"1-13","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"2024 ACM SIGPLAN International Work- shop on Partial Evaluation and Program Manipulation (PEPM ’24)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85182930621"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-88bb5d01-eb12-4000-8143-c8ce327eea19"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"The Genesis of Mix: Early Days of Self-Applicable Partial Evaluation : Invited Contribution)","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-718884","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
{"abstract":"I dag er otte ud af ti it-udviklere mænd. Vi har fire konkrete forslag til at få en mere mangfoldig og nuanceret digitalisering, der bidrager til at løse vores store samfundsudfordringer, skriver fem it-eksperter.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Iversen, Ole Sejer","Gregersen, Camilla","Misfeldt, Morten","Bjørn, Pernille","Sestoft, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-728627"],"filters":{"added":"2024-05","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["CCTD"],"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Dansk Magisterforening"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000005 it eksperter sådan får vi mere diversitet på it uddannelserne","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/digital/artikel/fem-it-eksperter-saadan-faar-vi-mere-diversitet-paa-it-uddannelserne","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-728627","ids":["au-dcf460c9-d680-4022-b63c-92b63b498854"],"keyword":["#CCTD"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-E69AB69757E5A8D17A4EE896997AEADF"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Department of Digital Design and Information Studies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar"