{"abstract":"Alt for ofte kommer reformerne først og inddragelsen på bagkant. Vi er nødt til at lave uddannelsespolitik på en ny måde, skriver 18 forskere, dekaner, professorer og rektorer fra uddannelsesverdenen.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Andersen, Hanne","Binning, Philip John","Bruun, Mette Birkedal","Gregersen, Frans","Harrits, Gitte Sommer","Holmer, Marianne","Hvas, Anne-Mette","Jacobsen, Brian Arly","Juul, Annegrete","Nielsen, Jan Alexis","Nosch, Marie Louise Bech","Pristed, Birgitte Beck","Salmonsen, Esben Bjørn","Sestoft, Peter","Tangkjær, Christian","Ulriksen, Lars","Vedersø, Birgitte","Vetner, Mikael"],"cuid":["S02-096.70-751545"],"filters":{"added":"2023-11","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"pop","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Danske Studerendes Fællesråds"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-CBS","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU","DI-UC-KP","DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000018 markante uddannelsesstemmer utålmodig reformiver er ineffektiv uddannelsespolitik","src":["aau","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/18-markante-uddannelsesstemmer-i-opraab-utaalmodighed-skaber-ineffektive-uddannelsesreformer","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-096.70-751545","ids":["aau-46ef91fe-6ee3-4f6b-9602-33dddb022517","ku-037aede2-d059-4dac-828a-7b3130a776c9"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-2-0F193215084E076B4218A7DB6DC66B84"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.altinget.dk/forskning/artikel/18-markante-uddannelsesstemmer-i-opraab