{"abstract":"We use separation logic to specify and verify a Java program that implements snapshotable search trees, fully formalizing the speci- cation and verication in the Coq proof assistant. We achieve local and modular reasoning about a tree and its snapshots and their iterators, al- though the implementation involves shared mutable heap data structures with no separation or ownership relation between the various data. The paper also introduces a series of four increasingly sophisticated im- plementations and veries the rst one. The others are included as future work and as a set of challenge problems for full functional specication and verication, whether by separation logic or by other formalisms.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Mehnert, Hannes","Sieczkowski, Filip","Birkedal, Lars","Sestoft, Peter"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382054"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Coq Proof Assistant","Local and Modular Reasoning","Separation logic","Shared Mutable Heap Data Structures","Snapshotable Search Trees"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"formalized verification of snapshotable trees separation and sharing","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/37621531/snapshots_conf.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-382054","identifier":[{"id":"84856557674","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-35a9addf-75f0-40d3-aab1-4d3f23e265a1"],"keyword":["Coq Proof Assistant","Local and Modular Reasoning","Separation Logic","Shared Mutable Heap Data Structures","Snapshotable Search Trees"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FDE57B13B696541EB9B6F7008E3F2822"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-27705-4_15","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/37621531/snapshots_conf.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["The Department, Software & Systems"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Hannes","key":"mehnertpau","last":"Mehnert","name":"Mehnert, Hannes","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Filip","key":"sieczkowskipau","last":"Sieczkowski","name":"Sieczkowski, Filip","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"birkedalpau","last":"Birkedal","name":"Birkedal, Lars","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"sestoftpau","last":"Sestoft","locid":"0ee7ba1e-3108-4db3-a908-97977980d032","name":"Sestoft, Peter","orcid":"0000-0002-5843-6021","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-642-27705-4_15","isbn":["9783642277047"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"179-195","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"4th International Conference, VSTTE 2012, Philadelphia, PA, USA, January 28-29, 2012. Proceedings","title":"Verified Software: Theories, Tools, Experiments","volume":"7152"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84856557674"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-35a9addf-75f0-40d3-aab1-4d3f23e265a1"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Formalized Verification of Snapshotable Trees: Separation and Sharing","